sequenceDiagram
    actor Commander
    participant Browser
    participant Action as actions/game.php
    participant Service as Domain Service
    participant DB as MariaDB/MySQL
    participant Events as game_events

    Commander->>Browser: Submit intent with CSRF field
    Browser->>Action: POST action and validated identifiers
    Action->>Action: Authenticate and verify CSRF/RBAC
    Action->>Service: Delegate player-scoped mutation
    Service->>DB: BEGIN transaction
    Service->>DB: Lock ownership, resources, queue, and cooldown rows
    Service->>Service: Validate prerequisites and calculate authoritative result
    Service->>DB: Update domain rows
    Service->>Events: Write audit/game event
    Events->>DB: Insert event in same transaction
    Service->>DB: COMMIT
    Service-->>Action: Result and safe feedback
    Action-->>Browser: Redirect or refreshed state
    Browser-->>Commander: Render success, error, or protected state
